19 级专硕研究生成绩评定期末卷面70%，平时成绩30%。 平时成绩：出勤10 分，课堂表现

10 分，作业10 分。缺勤1 次扣4 分，迟到1 次扣2 分。请假1 次扣

1 分。作业：写作1 次，翻译1 次。期末考试时间：大约在10 月份。

Requirements

Be autonomous in your English learning;

Be engaged in out-of-class listening practice;

Read the text critically and get ready for any activity in the classroom;

Accomplish the assigned oral tasks in class;

Get dynamically involved in any classroom activities;

Enlarge your vocabulary and language knowledge and improve your

sense of the target language;

Enrich yourself with knowledge of medicine-related issues;

Accomplish writing assignments;

Ensure your attendance.



Major tasks:

1. preview: words checking and questions after each text

2. Class participation

3. translation tasks and writing assignments

4. review: exercise and reciting dictation (once every unit)
